    "summary": "Use it in either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) or the opponent's [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), right after an enemy unit selects its targets. Pick 1 **HERETIC ASTARTES** unit of yours, not a **DAMNED** unit, that at least 1 of those attacks targets.\n\nWorsen the Armour Penetration of each attack that targets your unit by 1, until the attacking unit is done making its attacks. You cannot use this Stratagem and [Armour of Corruption](vsdata:ability/chaos-space-marines.warpstrike-champions.armour-of-corruption) on the same unit in 1 phase.",
